= Jiang Jieshi

The meteoric rise of Jiang Jieshi has been long in the making. An early supporter of Sun Yat-sen since before the 1911 revolution, Jiang Jieshi again and again has demonstrated his tenacity and dedication, rising through the ranks and utilizing his military connections until he has become a power broker to rival, if not exceed, the likes of Wang Jingwei and Liao Zhongkai.

